    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.79,
      "end_seconds": 200.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.88,
      "end_seconds": 216.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.27,
      "end_seconds": 242.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 36.5, pressure 114 over 70, pulse 75."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.49,
      "end_seconds": 246.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.41,
      "end_seconds": 251.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "stay as you are for a moment"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.45,
      "end_seconds": 273.5,
      "duration_seconds": 6.05,
      "text": "The whites of the eyes are yellow and the liver edge is tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.28,
      "end_seconds": 279.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.35,
      "end_seconds": 308.93,
      "duration_seconds": 11.58,
      "text": "Taking everything into account, I'm honestly not certain yet. It It could be acute hepatitis, possibly hepatitis A after travel, or it might be a gallstone blockage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.69,
      "end_seconds": 315.13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.44,
      "text": "Actually uh I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.29,
      "end_seconds": 332.36,
      "duration_seconds": 16.07,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like acute hepatitis, possibly hepatitis A after travel, but I'd like to to confirm. I want an ultrasound of the liver done, that's for jaundice."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 333.96,
      "end_seconds": 337.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "I can book that for Tuesday at 9 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.8,
      "end_seconds": 344.67,
      "duration_seconds": 5.87,
      "text": "let me think, you know, okay, I'll be there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.2,
      "end_seconds": 370.08,
      "duration_seconds": 24.88,
      "text": "I want liver blood tests done, that's for jaundice. I want a hepatitis screen done, that's for jaundice. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. Rest, avoid alcohol and wash your hands carefully, as it can spread. Please don't wait if the symptoms get worse. That's when to be seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 371.67,
      "end_seconds": 373.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "I'll remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 374.84,
      "end_seconds": 378.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "I'll want another look in one week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 378.82,
      "end_seconds": 383.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "Ah I'll book it on my way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 385.38,
      "end_seconds": 390.97,
      "duration_seconds": 5.59,
      "text": "Right, that's the plan. Do you want to to ask me anything?"
    },
